{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farmer\u2019s Market, a cozy low-poly farming simulator where country life comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, nurture, and harvest your own crops, then take your fresh produce to the market to sell, earn coins, and unlock new seeds, tools, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your farm at your own pace: expand your land, decorate your surroundings, and experiment with different crop combinations to maximize your profits. With its colorful low-poly style and relaxing atmosphere, it\u2019s perfect for fans of farming, simulation games, and the slow life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the most successful farmer in the region?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Seed of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949430/e84a8e5dbd2d4957fc7d1afc3b892140f1d1eb17.jpg"},{"name":"The First Harvest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949430/05c48a3179f7a5b6c418e3f11d2c9f5f9c19ec52.jpg"},{"name":"From Field to Market","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949430/b08a9f8b65a2961d71d4d379e9acd198634239ac.jpg"},{"name":"Farmer\u2019s Touch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949430/695496bdbeed4fb72a1f108d3a08b800c26a834a.jpg"},{"name":"Village Merchant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949430/e00e99efe2fde2985cca2445f3ded5da19e6e325.jpg"},{"name":"Market King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949430/fa4eab0931cee0f2df1b346b9eaeba814a55ddd9.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c